---The Execution resource contains detailed information of an individual integration execution.
---@class gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaExecution
---@field responseParams? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.EnterpriseCrmFrontendsEventbusProtoParameterEntryList
---@field name? string Auto-generated primary key.
---@field responseParameters? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaValueTypeMap Event parameters returned as part of the response. In the case of error, the `ErrorInfo` field is returned in the following format: { "ErrorInfo": { "message": String, "code": Number } }
---@field updateTime? string Output only. Last modified time of the execution.
---@field directSubExecutions? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaExecutionList Direct sub executions of the following Execution.
---@field executionMethod? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaExecutionExecutionMethodEnum The ways user posts this event.
