---@field cloudKmsKey? string Optional. Cloud KMS resource name for the CMEK encryption key.
---@field snapshotNumber? string Output only. An increasing sequence that is set when a new snapshot is created
---@field integrationVersionState? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaExecutionIntegrationVersionStateEnum Output only. State of the integration version
---@field replayInfo? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaExecutionReplayInfo Output only. Replay info for the execution
---@field triggerId? string The trigger id of the integration trigger config. If both trigger_id and client_id is present, the integration is executed from the start tasks provided by the matching trigger config otherwise it is executed from the default start tasks.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Created time of the execution.
---@field requestParams? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.EnterpriseCrmFrontendsEventbusProtoParameterEntryList Event parameters come in as part of the request.
---@field eventExecutionDetails? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.EnterpriseCrmEventbusProtoEventExecutionDetails The execution info about this event.
---@field requestParameters? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaValueTypeMap Event parameters come in as part of the request.
---@field executionDetails? gcp.unstable.integrations_v1.GoogleCloudIntegrationsV1alphaExecutionDetails Detailed info of this execution.

